# Repository-local ignores for the dotfiles repo itself.
# Machine-wide patterns (.DS_Store, editor dirs, secrets) live in
# .gitignore_global, which setup.sh registers via core.excludesfile.

# Regenerated by `brew bundle` on every run — a snapshot of one machine,
# not a declaration. nvim/lazy-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it
# pins plugin versions and must stay tracked.
Brewfile.lock.json

# TeX Live artefacts inside texmf/.
# ~/Library/texmf is a symlink to texmf/ here, so anything TeX writes to the
# user tree lands in this repo. Two sources:
#   - `tlmgr --usermode install` drops a whole package tree (fonts/, tlpkg/,
#     web2c/, plus the packages themselves). Declare packages in Texfile
#     instead — tex.sh installs them system-wide with sudo.
#   - `mktexlsr` regenerates ls-R, the kpathsea filename cache. tex.sh runs
#     it on every setup, so tracking it only produces phantom diffs.
texmf/ls-R
texmf/tlpkg/
texmf/web2c/
texmf/fonts/
texmf/tex/lualatex/
texmf/tex/latex/appendixnumberbeamer/
texmf/tex/latex/fira/
texmf/tex/latex/tcolorbox/
texmf/tex/latex/tikzfill/
